WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.446
Video 4. Proof of Match, Sync again, ane
Switch Report.

00:00:05.646 --> 00:00:11.312
Switch pachhi, Hisaab, Tally paasethi ena
potana reports maange chhe: ledgers,

00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:15.836
stock, baaki bills, Trial Balance, Profit &
Loss, ane Balance Sheet.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:22.848
Pachhi e darek line ne potana aankda ni baaju
ma muke chhe. Sarkhi line ne tick male chhe.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:29.453
Proof tame game tyare kholi shako chho. Go To
maate Alt+G dabavo, ane proof lakho.

00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:32.713
Enter dabavo. Proof of Match khule chhe.

00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:38.059
Uparni line saar kahe chhe: 46 maathi 44 lines
match thay chhe.

00:00:37.709 --> 00:00:42.586
ℹ no arth: baaki ni lines nu kaaran Hisaab ne
malyu chhe.

00:00:42.616 --> 00:00:48.831
Darek line ma Source Books ni value, Hisaab ni
value, Difference, ane tick dekhay chhe.

00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:54.139
F5 thi fakt differences dekhay chhe. Ahiya be
lines chhe.

00:00:54.169 --> 00:01:01.984
Sales Accounts ni line ma ₹4,500 no farak
chhe. Eni Match column kahe chhe: Cause found.

00:01:02.464 --> 00:01:07.973
Tally nu Trial Balance, Sales Accounts group
₹1,99,500 batave chhe.

00:01:07.903 --> 00:01:13.454
Pan eni potani ledger lines no sarvaalo
₹2,04,000 chhe, Hisaab jetlo

00:01:13.104 --> 00:01:18.249
j. Etle farak Tally na report ma chhe, tamara
chopda ma nahi.

00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:24.754
F6 thi difference accept thay chhe. Hisaab,
reason ma cause jaate bhare chhe.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:34.279
Ctrl+A thi save thay chhe, ane line ma Accepted dekhay chhe.
Darek line match thay ke accept thay, tyare switch puru.

00:01:35.359 --> 00:01:40.870
Thoda divas haju Tally ma bills naakho chho?
To fari Import › Switch from Tally kholo.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:46.793
Fari sync karva S dabavo. Fakt pherphaar aave
chhe: ahiya, ek navu invoice.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.290
Pachhi proof jaate farithi chaale chhe.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:56.563
Switch Report ma switch ni badhi vigat rahe
chhe. Go To ma, switch report lakho.

00:01:56.593 --> 00:02:03.426
Ema source, taarikh, masters ane vouchers,
darek bhaag no samay, ane proof dekhay chhe.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.556
Darek Sync again ni potani line hoy chhe.

00:02:07.956 --> 00:02:13.343
Chhelli line ma shu nathi aavtu e lakhyu chhe:
users ane passwords,

00:02:12.993 --> 00:02:17.820
juno Edit Log, ane print designs. E Hisaab ma
fari set karo.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:23.671
Tamaru switch saabit thayu. Aagal na video ma
Gateway ane keys joishu.

